      "content": "that makes sense. but it feels like the 'pro' side is mostly about giving families freedom and better opportunities, whereas the opposition just seems to be focused on protecting the status quo and keeping the money in the system. dont you think the argument for 'educational freedom' is more fundamentally about the child's wellbeing than just the budget stuff?",
